    "name": "Despite Time",
    "steam_appid": 3804560,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/8758198bfb540c9ede6d1b9d61acb2a6.poster.avif?t=1750662568\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/8758198bfb540c9ede6d1b9d61acb2a6.webp?t=1750662568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=720 height=480 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/f6f6c9d523b2365e1740c5060b4aa336.avif?t=1750662568\" width=720 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The concept of time and space just changed. A soul shattered and you are caught in the middle. Find out who or what was strong enough to rip time apart and why only your soul shattered. There is one goal - Recover your soul and &quot;repair&quot; time in the process!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It always hides where you\u2019ve already searched.&quot;\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/d4aa5639aa6c3ca20b8a5201bd3eed77.avif?t=1750662568\" width=720 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/f853c5c9b84bbbb990fd12ff6f150e63.poster.avif?t=1750662568\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/f853c5c9b84bbbb990fd12ff6f150e63.webm?t=1750662568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite Time is a ground breaking Action RPG with a fast paced battlesystem featuring any weapon you can imagine. Be it a common one like a sword, bow or handgun or special ones like a scythe or magic. Combine all of these to your liking. Why not having a sword in one hand and a gun in the other? Or maybe just use your bare fists.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/b87df97b7178491c9f09831b9e7c8b9d.avif?t=1750662568\" width=720 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore fantasy worlds of endless possibilities. From dark fantasy dungeons to cyberpunk cities. From fighting pirates on a ship to a duel at high noon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/c01b7e2c0ddc297fa6877c2711b52a30.poster.avif?t=1750662568\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/c01b7e2c0ddc297fa6877c2711b52a30.webm?t=1750662568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>These worlds in form of Dungeons regenerate each time you enter them, creating different routes and possibilities of yet unseen secrets to discover. The rooms are handcrafted with attention to detail to bring you immersive and ever changing worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/bc47ec520d0dc381873acc845e959572.avif?t=1750662568\" width=720 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every piece of armor on enemies can be dropped and equipped. Mix and match the armor that suits your playstyle the best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But we all know, it's all about fashion, therefore we have a skin system in place, so you can change your appearance without having to miss out on your favorite stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/ba34c7905428be5c628aa2dcd4b6b029.poster.avif?t=1750662568\" width=500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/ba34c7905428be5c628aa2dcd4b6b029.webm?t=1750662568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/ba34c7905428be5c628aa2dcd4b6b029.mp4?t=1750662568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also find Modifiers which can apply elemental effects to your attacks, make projectiles split, homing or bouncing and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/a8339c21dc32caa9f82daa2081c068bf.avif?t=1750662568\" width=720 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you traverse the diverse timelines, there is a lot of loot to be found. Even though Equipment, Style and Modifiers are important, there is more you can do to get stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unique character progression also allows you to get stronger at the things by actually doing them. Doding a lot makes your dodges more reliable, parrying consistently results in stronger counter attacks. Using a weapon unlocks new abilities for its type and so much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/60a1ba4463f1427da06201ca5475629c.avif?t=1750662568\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/8758198bfb540c9ede6d1b9d61acb2a6.poster.avif?t=1750662568\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/8758198bfb540c9ede6d1b9d61acb2a6.webp?t=1750662568\" class=\"bb_img\" width=720 height=480 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/f6f6c9d523b2365e1740c5060b4aa336.avif?t=1750662568\" width=720 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The concept of time and space just changed. A soul shattered and you are caught in the middle. Find out who or what was strong enough to rip time apart and why only your soul shattered. There is one goal - Recover your soul and &quot;repair&quot; time in the process!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It always hides where you\u2019ve already searched.&quot;\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/d4aa5639aa6c3ca20b8a5201bd3eed77.avif?t=1750662568\" width=720 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/f853c5c9b84bbbb990fd12ff6f150e63.poster.avif?t=1750662568\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/f853c5c9b84bbbb990fd12ff6f150e63.webm?t=1750662568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite Time is a ground breaking Action RPG with a fast paced battlesystem featuring any weapon you can imagine. Be it a common one like a sword, bow or handgun or special ones like a scythe or magic. Combine all of these to your liking. Why not having a sword in one hand and a gun in the other? Or maybe just use your bare fists.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/b87df97b7178491c9f09831b9e7c8b9d.avif?t=1750662568\" width=720 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore fantasy worlds of endless possibilities. From dark fantasy dungeons to cyberpunk cities. From fighting pirates on a ship to a duel at high noon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/c01b7e2c0ddc297fa6877c2711b52a30.poster.avif?t=1750662568\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/c01b7e2c0ddc297fa6877c2711b52a30.webm?t=1750662568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>These worlds in form of Dungeons regenerate each time you enter them, creating different routes and possibilities of yet unseen secrets to discover. The rooms are handcrafted with attention to detail to bring you immersive and ever changing worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/bc47ec520d0dc381873acc845e959572.avif?t=1750662568\" width=720 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every piece of armor on enemies can be dropped and equipped. Mix and match the armor that suits your playstyle the best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But we all know, it's all about fashion, therefore we have a skin system in place, so you can change your appearance without having to miss out on your favorite stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/ba34c7905428be5c628aa2dcd4b6b029.poster.avif?t=1750662568\" width=500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/ba34c7905428be5c628aa2dcd4b6b029.webm?t=1750662568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/ba34c7905428be5c628aa2dcd4b6b029.mp4?t=1750662568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also find Modifiers which can apply elemental effects to your attacks, make projectiles split, homing or bouncing and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/a8339c21dc32caa9f82daa2081c068bf.avif?t=1750662568\" width=720 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you traverse the diverse timelines, there is a lot of loot to be found. Even though Equipment, Style and Modifiers are important, there is more you can do to get stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unique character progression also allows you to get stronger at the things by actually doing them. Doding a lot makes your dodges more reliable, parrying consistently results in stronger counter attacks. Using a weapon unlocks new abilities for its type and so much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804560/extras/60a1ba4463f1427da06201ca5475629c.avif?t=1750662568\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
